                <table id="recin682672582" class="r" style="margin:0 auto;border-spacing:0;width:600px" align="center">
                  <tbody><tr>
                    <td style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:15px;padding-left:30px;padding-right:30px">
                      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%">
                        <tbody><tr>
                          <td style="text-align:left;padding:0 0 0">
                            <div style="margin-right:auto;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#444;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4"> <center><strong>How can I pay my loan?</strong></center>
                              <br>There are two ways you can make repayments for your Salmon loan products:
                              <br><ul><li>Using the Salmon app — the most secure repayment method with no additional fees.</li>
                              <li>Without the Salmon app — make repayments through external channels like e-wallets, bank apps, or self-service kiosks. Please note that <strong>some fees may apply</strong>, which are collected by our payment partners.</li></ul>
                              <strong>Using the Salmon app</strong>
                              <br>Log in to the <a href="{{{salmon_link}}}" style="color:#ea5347;border-bottom:2px solid #ea5347;box-shadow:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Salmon app</a> using the mobile number you registered during the application process. Once logged in, select the loan product you wish to repay from the options available on the Home screen.
                              <ul><li><strong>GCash / Maya (Recommended)</strong>
                              <br><strong>The fastest and easiest option:</strong> select GCash or Maya, generate the QR Ph code, and upload it to your chosen e-wallet app.</li>
                              <li>Banks (UnionBank, RCBC, BDO, and BPI)
                              <br>The Salmon app will redirect you to your selected bank’s app to complete your payment.</li>
                              <li>Over-the-counter (7-Eleven, Cebuana Lhuillier, and SM Bills Payment)</li></ul>
                              Generate your payment barcode/code from the app and visit one of the listed partners to make your repayment.
                              <br><br>All repayments made through the Salmon app come with no transaction fees with instant SMS/push confirmation of your repayment, and our support team is available 24/7 to help you along the way in case of any questions or requests.
                              <br><br><strong>Without the Salmon app</strong>
                              <br><br>Outside the Salmon app, you can pay through various <strong>self-service kiosks</strong> or <strong>our partners’ apps</strong>.
                              <br><br>To make your payment, remember to use your <strong>loan account number</strong>. You can easily find this in the <strong>Salmon app</strong>. Just tap your loan product on the <strong>Home screen</strong> and check the <strong>Account details</strong> section.
                              <br><br><strong>Self-service kiosks </strong> 
                              <br>Find the nearest CLiQQ, ECPay, or eTap kiosk and look for Salmon under the <strong>“Bills”</strong> section:
                              <ul><li>CLiQQ – available at 7-Eleven stores nationwide</li>
                              <li>ECPay – available at TrueMoney, Puregold, and other partner outlets</li>
                              <li>eTap – available in select locations</li></ul>
                              <strong>Mobile apps:</strong> Open any of the listed apps and find Salmon under the “Bills” section
                              <ul><li>GCash/Maya</li>
                              <li>Globe</li>
                              <li>BDO</li>
                              <li>PalawanPay</li></ul>
                              An <strong>₱18 service fee</strong> applies when you pay through these services. This fee is charged by our payment partners. <strong>Payments made through the Salmon app remain free of charge.</strong> 
                              <br><br>If you have any questions, just check out our <a href="{{{help_page}}}" style="color:#ea5347;border-bottom:2px solid #ea5347;box-shadow:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> FAQ page</a> — it’s full of helpful answers.
                              </div></td></tr>
